    "title": "Chris Garagiola Named D-backs TV Play-by-Play Voice for 2027 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n11 hours ago\nChris Garagiola will become the Diamondbacks’ television play-by-play announcer on DBACKS.TV in 2027. The Phoenix native has spent the past three seasons calling the team’s radio broadcasts and will carry on a family legacy: his father helped build the franchise, and his grandfather, Hall of Famer Joe Garagiola Sr., was a longtime D-backs broadcaster.\nRead full article",
